  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「うん、うん。了解だわさ、むしろ『ちょうどいい』かな～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 61,
    "dress": "old-w-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 518
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「うん。あんたには話したっけ、あたしちょっと事情があって実家に帰りづらくてさ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 61,
    "dress": "old-w-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 518
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「このままテキトーにどっかの国に行って、武者修行でもしてこようかなって」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 61,
    "dress": "old-w-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 518
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「にゃはは～、あたしより強いやつに会いにいくっ♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 61,
    "dress": "old-w-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 518
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「行き先は決めてなかったから。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 61,
    "dress": "old-w-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 518
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「そのアイカちゃんとユキちゃんだっけ、そのふたりのお守りとして同伴するのも構わないわさ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「むしろ、渡りに船かな～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 61,
    "dress": "old-w-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 518
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「ちょっと今回は、暴力だけじゃどうにもならない因縁を抱えちゃってね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「しょうじき困ってるっていうか、当て処がないっていうかね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「……いや、いいよ。あんたを信用してないわけじゃないけど、『こういうこと』に友達を巻きこみたくないから」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「先延ばしにしてた運命が、あたしを迎えにきた。哀しいけど、時間切れだわさ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 61,
    "dress": "old-w-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 518
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「むしろ、高校卒業まで待ってもらえたんだから。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「あたしは幸せものだわさ、すっごい充実した青春を過ごせたしね～。もう心残りは、そんなにない」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 61,
    "dress": "old-w-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 518
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「後輩たちのことを考えると、ちょっと心配だけどね……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 61,
    "dress": "old-w-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 518
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「あたしたちの後継者は、あたしたちが守る必要もないぐらい強くなってくれたから」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「そう信じてるから。うん、うん……。ありがとね、『図書室』の」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「あんたってさぁ……。けっきょく、あたしなんかよりずっとお節介なんだよね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 61,
    "dress": "old-w-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 518
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「おまけに、とびきり優しい良い子♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「にゃはは～☆　怒らない怒らない、愛してるから……。んじゃあ、ね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 61,
    "dress": "old-w-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 518
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「三年間、ありがとう」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「……さて、と。それじゃあ、山條ぎんちゃん最後の戦いに向かっちゃおう」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
